  "notes": "REGISTER:\nPolite/formal (お + {詫|わ}び). The お- prefix makes it more polite.\n\nUSAGE:\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦{申|もう}し{上|あ}げます→申し上げる：01734_moushiageru⟧ (I humbly apologize - very formal)\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦いたします→いたす：01314_itasu⟧ (I apologize - formal)\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{言葉|ことば}→言葉：02880_kotoba⟧ (words of apology)\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{品|しな}→品：03192_shina⟧/⟦{印|しるし}→印：03254_shirushi⟧ (gift of apology)\n\nIN BUSINESS:\n- お{詫|わ}び{状|じょう} (letter of apology)\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦{文|ぶん}→文：03716_bun⟧ (apology statement)\n- お{詫|わ}び⟦と→と：00512_to⟧⟦お{知|し}らせ→お知らせ：18843_oshirase⟧ (apology and notice)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- お{詫|わ}び (formal apology)\n- ⟦{謝罪|しゃざい}→謝罪：06754_shazai⟧ (apology - more formal, often public)\n- ⟦ごめんなさい→ごめんなさい：00931_gomennasai⟧ (sorry - casual)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{詫|わ}びる→詫びる：14174_wabiru⟧ (to apologize - verb)\n- ⟦{謝|あやま}る→謝る：01177_ayamaru⟧ (to apologize)\n- ⟦{陳謝|ちんしゃ}→陳謝：07994_chinsha⟧ (formal apology)",
